WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Rear balance shaft
What it does: Completes the mass pair that reduces secondary vibration in the four-cylinder engine.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Rear balance shaft
How it works: The mass turns opposite to its partner.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Rear balance shaft
How it moves: Rotates at twice crankshaft speed, counter-rotating relative to the front shaft.
